00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.360
<b>「The beginning of darkness</b>

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.360
<b>「The beginning of darkness</b>

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.360
<b>~That Time~」</b>

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.360
<b>~That Time~」</b>

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.400
Are you awake, Rito-san?

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.490
Did you have a good dream?

00:02:58.490 --> 00:02:59.450
Momo!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:02.620
Would you just cut it out with this mischief already-!

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.530
It's not mischief, it's development.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:07.580
D-Development?!

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:12.420
I'm offering my body to draw out the
carnivorous nature hidden in you, Rito-san.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:15.210
There really has been an effect, too.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:19.420
Your beastliness when you're asleep has been gradually becoming more and more incredible, Rito-san.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:21.930
How about it?

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:25.350
Don't you think it's about time to try doing it when you're awake?

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.140
I don't mind.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.770
I am the person behind the Harem Plan, after all.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.770
I-I haven't accepted the Harem yet, so-!

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:38.900
As usual, when he's awake he has an impenetrable wall.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.900
Are you still saying that?

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:45.530
There's no mistake that you have the
capability to be a harem king, Rito-san.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:49.790
There have been plenty of accomplishments up until now to prove it.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.250
Flags are already being raised all over the place!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.420
W-What are you basing that claim on?!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.460
My woman's intuition.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.590
Moreover, Yami-san is also...

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.090
Eh?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:05.510
The greatest hindrance to the creation of the Harem Plan...

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:09.350
I thought it was her, who was after your life.

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:14.850
But now I don't think Yami-san would hurt you, Rito-san.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.900
If you push a little more, she'll fall as well.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:21.860
Eh?!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:24.990
M-Mikado, is it really okay like this...?

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.200
It's fine isn't it?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.160
It suits you.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.160
Ah! It's wonderful, isn't it!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.160
I chose it for your sake.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.290
You should thank me.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:36.250
But... I think there are swimsuits for school.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.000
Those are only for students.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.590
Eh, is that so?

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:42.050
Well, that seems like it would be pretty good in itself, too.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.260
Mikado!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.430
Geez...

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:49.180
Trans!

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:54.440
Look, these are Shameless-senpai's boobs!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.480
Hey!

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.900
Mea-san, don't use trans for strange things!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.280
Are you listening to me, Mea-san?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:04.200
In the first place, why are you using it for something like-

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.160
It seems Mea-chan has been accepted by everyone.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.280
She's a bit too high-spirited, isn't she.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.500
Yami-chan!

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.630
Tearju-sensei...

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.010
Yami-san is the same as ever.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.600
The first time Yami-chan and I met?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.010
I've been wanting to ask you.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:35.350
It was a black-market-doctor and patient relation, right?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.730
That's right.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.400
But since she's strong,

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.440
she only became injured enough to come to me once in a while.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.490
The first time I met her, it was horrible.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.570
She was injured,

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.110
but she had also exhausted her physical strength greatly,

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:52.410
and she herself didn't know how she had reached me,

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.700
having lost several days' memory.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.750
What happened?

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:58.580
I have no idea.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.040
I wondered that myself.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.340
What could have happened to Golden Darkness,

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.470
who was long since a legend?

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:13.390
I asked her about it when we met again on Earth, but it seems her memories of that time still haven't returned.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.470
Is that so?

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.940
Nemesis said it before:

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:22.270
Yami-san is aware of it unconsciously...

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:25.480
Her true self... Darkness.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.400
Momo~

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.950
Momo~

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.280
Whether it's one thing or another,

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:34.030
Ah, so pure~

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:34.240
there are still hindrances to the Harem Plan, aren't there...?

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:40.000
She's so beautiful~

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.290
Despite what I said to Rito-san,

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:39.160
I guess it's still too early to be optimistic, huh...

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:44.500
That gaze~

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:46.710
But could you please be quiet while I'm trying to think,

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.550
Just like a goddess~

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.550
people from the VMC?

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.720
Yami-chan, yo!

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:54.930
Hello.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:58.140
So, did you really buy that...?

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.020
Yami.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.030
What is it?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:12.700
Ah, Um... It's about Tearju-sensei.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.490
What about Tear?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.790
Ah... Um...

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.120
If you don't have any business, I'm leaving.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:20.540
Ah...!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.500
Tearju-sensei and you are family, right?

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.880
If you can, I think it would be good for you to get along better.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:33.970
I mean, you've already told everyone about Mea.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.770
There's no reason to conceal your relationship with Tearju-sensei anymore, is there?

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.890
Even if you don't tell everyone at school, at least Lala and the others-

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:41.890
Yuuki Rito.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:47.360
I announced my relationship to Mea because I felt the need.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:53.240
I hate giving others more information
about my circumstances than necessary.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.820
Because I was raised to be contrary.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:59.910
So because there is no need to, I will 
not announce my relationship with Tear.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.960
I think my modest progress toward her is sufficient.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.960
Your meddling is unneeded.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:11.340
Why do you meddle with me in the first place?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.260
I don't understand.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:17.010
How many times have I told you that you're my target?

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:19.600
That's...

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.310
I want you to become happy, Yami.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.610
Ah... Eh... Um... I mean...

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:36.200
See... You told me about your past, and after hearing that, I-

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.990
That's none of your concern.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.990
Ah... Yeah, I guess that's so.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.290
I'm sorry.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.620
If you push a little more, she'll fall as well.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.580
That Momo...!

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.840
Anyway, I'll be going now-

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:49.550
Ah...

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:04.810
It seems you no longer obey the laws of physics now.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.100
For now, I'll kill you.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:08.690
I-I'm sorry!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.360
It's fine, it's fine.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.320
Even if she says that, she won't really...

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.240
That's dangerous!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.740
That's really dangerous!

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:27.500
Hmm... I guess I should save him, after all.

