00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:48.810
Are you okay?

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.810
T-Thank you.

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:55.070
Hey, Sairenji-san.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.530
Why are you clinging to a boy like that?

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:58.320
It's shameless!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.320
No fair!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.570
Making a move is against the rules!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.200
Huh?!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.080
It's not that, I was just-!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.330
That's right, Sairenji saved me-

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.250
Ah! Rito and Haruna!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.580
It looks like you're having a good time!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:11.960
Please don't make this conversation any more complicated!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:21.600
Ah...

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:26.850
Yami-chan.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:31.770
Ah... T-The next class will be starting soon, so hurry up.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.230
Yes.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:35.480
I'm going ahead.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:36.150
Tear.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:36.780
Eh?

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:40.530
Let's go together.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.040
Yeah! {Yami isn't saying anything after this, just chuckling a bit}

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.050
Here I go!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:20.490
Wow! Tearju-sensei, so bold!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:23.820
I-I wonder if it was too bold after all...

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.160
It's fine, it's fine!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:28.200
I feel sorry for the boys, who can't see this!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.210
I... I...

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.210
Don't worry about it, Nana.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.010
Why you...!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:45.510
What? I even backed you up!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.220
Huh?! How is that backing me up?!

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.060
You're not backing me up at all!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.520
What are you getting so upset about?

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.020
You really are a child.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.730
Yami-chan!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:54.770
Don't call me a child!

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.480
Yami-chan, come join us.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:56.650
Let's play together!

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:57.570
Yes.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:58.900
In a little bit.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:11:59.480
Really?

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:01.320
I'll see you in a bit, then.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.030
It'll come soon. {Momo}

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.990
What do you mean it'll come soon?!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.080
Those two are fighting again.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:11.250
It seems there's a saying on Earth: "The more you fight, the better you get along".

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.080
Eh... As expected of Yami-oneechan.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.580
You're so knowledgeable.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:21.420
But if you say that, does it mean since we don't fight much we aren't getting along?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.930
It's not necessarily limited to that.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.590
Right?

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.930
Instead, it may be from now on.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:30.810
Hm?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:34.770
We've only just become sisters.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:38.320
That kind of thing may start from now.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:43.030
Specifically because we're close, we may conflict with each other.

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:44.820
We can understand each other, as well.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.830
I think that's what being sisters is like.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:51.200
That's true, isn't it?

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:56.670
Whether you're born as a person or a weapon that doesn't change, does it?

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:03.010
You've become able to listen and be honest, haven't you?

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.050
Eh?

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.300
I've been honest from the start.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:11.680
I've been thinking all this time.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:14.180
"How long can I stay here?"

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.650
"I'm a weapon."

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.730
"Staying here forever is strange."

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:26.110
But you cleared that haze from my heart, Mea.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.200
I did?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:32.040
You, who are like a reflection of myself, are living in this town.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.790
You're becoming involved with people.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:39.250
Seeing you being accepted by people, I've realised...

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:42.210
No, I was able to learn it.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:49.180
That it's absurd to be concerned with such trivial things like whether you're a weapon or a person in this town.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:56.230
That this town... The people here... They will accept you.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:10.280
That it's okay for us to be here.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:12.910
Yeah.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.450
That's right, isn't it?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:26.670
Ah?

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:28.550
Huh?

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:30.090
Yami-oneechan?

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:33.510
Ah?!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.310
Eh?

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.070
Yami-san?

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.410
W-What's going on?

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:53.410
Yami-oneechan?!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:55.580
T-This phenomenon is-!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.670
T-This is...

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.050
Y-Yami-oneechan!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:09.090
U-Using trans for something like that is so bold!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:13.010
What are you misunderstanding, Mea?

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.100
This is the release.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:15.810
Master!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:18.850
The true form of the organic weapon Eve.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.270
Her transformation into Darkness.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:25.190
Changing the method was a success.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:29.070
This was the condition for releasing Darkness.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.320
Mea-san! <i>Master...?</i>

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.990
Where is Nemesis?

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.410
What do you mean <i>where?</i>

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.080
Look, Master is over there-

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.080
H-Huh...?

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.290
It's pointless, Mea.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.080
Right now, only you can perceive me.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:47.170
I'm a different being from Yami and you.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:49.880
But my cute little servant Mea,

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:52.050
you have nothing to be concerned about.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.510
Everything I do now...

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:00.640
...Is for the sake of the future of the three of us.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.730
Mea's hair is...

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.230
...Turning black!

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:07.270
Mea!

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:09.480
I was always thinking about it.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:15.450
And now I finally understand what the conditions for releasing Darkness are.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:20.160
It is a peaceful heart, which a weapon must not possess,

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:23.250
and your wholehearted acceptance of it.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:28.460
So I finally get to meet the real you.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:35.840
Where is this...?

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.930
Ah! Master!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.390
Why are you inside my consciousness?!

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.180
What's happening?!

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:46.560
Stay there for a while, Mea.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.320
The conditions for Darkness have been met.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.610
What's left now is...

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.860
Yami-oneechan...!

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:01.200
It activates by accepting a peaceful heart?!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:05.040
That kind of program was planted in Eve without my knowing?!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:12.210
Based on your state, you seem to have understood the nature of Darkness a bit, Doctor Tearju.

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.380
That's right.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:17.140
Darkness is rampant trans ability.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:20.600
In other words, a state of limiter release.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:22.810
With the limitless trans power,

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:26.690
it surpasses an anti-personnel weapon
and becomes an anti-planetary weapon.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:36.860
When you realised this danger previously, you tried to suppress the risk of its awakening by educating Golden Darkness as a human.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:44.910
But the scientists who exiled you implanted that system into the mind of the juvenile Yami.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:48.670
As the ultimate trans, the Darkness System.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:54.670
I thought turning Golden Darkness to a killer would be a shortcut, but...

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:58.180
...after living in this town and seeing Mea change,

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.390
I finally arrived at that conclusion.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:03.680
Peace itself is the key.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:13.070
Darkness is a time bomb set for the universe as it headed for peace after the conclusion of the great galactic war.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.740
Mea, what kind of gag is this...?

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.030
You're wrong, Nana.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.740
That isn't Mea-san.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.300
It is as Princess Momo says.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.840
I am Nemesis.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.600
This is the first time I've met Princess Nana and Tearju, right?

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.010
Nice to meet you!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:45.390
Don't be so casual!

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:47.350
What is this, Nemesis?!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.810
Oh, scary.

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:51.730
I tried being playful, didn't I?

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:56.570
Don't you have a retort about the way I nonchalantly
changed my school swimsuit to white, Princess Momo?

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:57.820
That doesn't matter!

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:02.570
You're... Mea's Master...?

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:05.580
Then... Where is the real Mea?

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:10.420
I'm sorry Princess Nana, and Golden Darkness.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:15.590
Mea never existed in the first place.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.300
Huh?

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:23.390
"Mea" is a quasi-personality that I created.

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:26.970
It is nothing more than something that I, who am weak at involving myself with people, prepared.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.140
Master, what are you saying?!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.730
I'm right here!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:35.020
It was pointless.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:37.900
The warmth of a person's heart...

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:40.900
There's no way it would reach a little sister that doesn't exist, is there?

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.160
Yami-oneechan!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:45.780
You're lying!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.580
You just changed into Mea's appearance and took her place!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.160
Let Mea go!

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.290
Nana-chan!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.670
Well, I can't blame you for not believing me.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:20:00.170
But even if that's the case for you, I don't think it is for Yami.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:04.680
She was having a conversation with her until just now.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:16.020
In this state, she shouldn't be able to make a calm judgment.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:20.610
What's important now is the excessive stress to her heart.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.380
Yami-chan! Calm your heart!

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:45.510
The realisation that she is a being incompatible with peace,

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:49.180
and the despair that Mea was an illusion...

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:53.520
...will make Darkness that much stronger!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.860
So, because of that...

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.740
Was there some kind of flash of light just now?

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:06.870
Like thunder and lightning?

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:08.620
What's wrong, Peke?

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:13.620
I've detected some sort of terribly dense energy source.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:23.090
Yami-chan...

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:43.030
We meet at last.

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:45.490
How do you feel, Darkness?

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:55.910
I feel really perverted!

