00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:22.770
<b>saa yukou</b>

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:22.770
<b>さあ行こう</b>

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:22.770
<b>Now let's go!</b>

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:29.570
<b>fui ni tsumujikaze omowazu shagamikomu</b>

